Now the crowd in the café has decreased a bit.
Sunita called me near her.
She took out fresh and soft buns.
"Maya, I will cut this first bun," she said.
She cut that soft bread perfectly with a knife.
Then she applied a lot of butter on it.
"Now you prepare the second bun," Sunita told me.
I took the knife and that second bun in my hand.
I cut that soft bun gently.
And applied a lot of butter on it.
"Very nice!"
Sunita said smiling.
I liked this hands-on work a lot.
We prepared many buns while chatting.
I am learning to cut buns quickly.
I am very happy today.
I have learned to do so many new things in just one morning!
